  "description": "After graduating from high school, Junseong moved down to his grandfather's house in the countryside. Then, Wooju comes to visit him. Using\na wish bet from their high school days as an excuse, Wooju decides to stay at Junseong's house for a month.\n\nOne ordinary day, Wooju asks Junseong,\n\n\"Do you think we're friends?\"\n\nWooju had always been hard to read, but meeting him again made him even more difficult to understand.\nEven his unexpected question.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Chapters](https://ridibooks.com/books/6348000002), [Volumes](https://ridibooks.com/books/6348000001)",
